        "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-044-wudifive-nan:p002",
        "quote": "母樂容華有寵，故武帝留心。",
        "note": "依同段姓名、引者及所答者。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanshi-044-wudifive-nan:p003:r0005",
